    {
      "name": "05_cost_aware_variant",
      "kind": "schematic",
      "caption": "The tested cost-aware engineering variant. Native exact computations only select witness work. A batch activates compact proofs only when predicted savings cover loading/setup and a margin. Every request is retained and publicly verified. This variant is not silently inserted into the existing methodology text.",
